{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"The Thoroughbred: a past life story","html":"<article id='ja24'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Jātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Stories of Past Lives 24 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Kuruṅgavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Four-horned Antelope </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>4. Ājaññajātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Thoroughbred: a past life story </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Yadā yadā yattha yadā, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Whenever whenever, wherever whenever, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>yattha yattha yadā yadā; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>wherever wherever, whenever whenever: </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Ājañño kurute vegaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>the thoroughbred drives onward, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>hāyanti tattha vāḷavā”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>while the geldings fade right there. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>Ājaññajātakaṁ catutthaṁ. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
